WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:04.463
♪♪

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:07.341
The show, TEHRAN, is very
exciting.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:10.010
♪♪

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.011
Engage. Engage!

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.012
♪♪

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.431
Niv:
It's about an Israeli secret
agent...

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:17.017
...on a mission, undercover in
Iran.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.604
♪♪

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:23.774
Her sole job is to plant a
virus...

00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:25.567
Daniel:
in Tehran's anti-aircraft
defense.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:30.030
♪♪

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.657
Moshe:
She's cool. She's smart.

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.034
Moshe:
And she will do anything to
succeed in her mission.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.327
Which is very dangerous.

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:38.038
You have forty seven minutes, you will
be home by tomorrow afternoon.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:38.789
Alright.

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:40.582
Very fast, everything goes
wrong.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:43.210
♪♪

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.004
♪♪

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:49.383
And now she is stuck in Tehran,
running for her life.

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:56.640
♪♪

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.853
♪♪

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.481
But she never gives up, she
never quits.

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:06.275
♪♪

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:08.944
Niv:
She keeps trying to fill her
mission.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:10.821
In many kinds of ways.

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:11.863
♪♪

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:12.572
(Bam)

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.865
She's a badass girl.

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:19.746
♪♪

00:01:20.998 --> 00:01:21.623
♪♪

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:26.962
♪♪

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:28.505
The cops are here, you have to
get out.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:30.090
Tamar:
We're not gonna get another
chance.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.801
The show has amazing action.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:36.138
♪♪

00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:37.097
Tamar:
I need your help.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.098
Let's go.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.100
♪♪

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.935
We start asking ourself: who is
the good guy and...

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:42.644
who's the bad guy?

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:44.229
♪♪

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.106
Daniel:
And you want to know the end of
the story.

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.066
♪♪

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.818
Take her out of there tonight!

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:53.113
♪♪

